      "text": "fun fact - PowerShell is primarily case-insensitive.\n\nI don't always use CamelCase in PowerShell.\n\nSometimes I'll use $javascriptStyle = 'variables'\n\nSometimes I'll use ${css-style} = '--variable: values'\n\nPeople have a lot of presumptions about PowerShell.\n\nMost of them wrong."
